WEBVTT

00:19:04.996 --> 00:19:07.954
OK, so I'm going to see you
in two weeks when we move

00:19:07.954 --> 00:19:10.329
on to step two of this process

00:19:10.496 --> 00:19:15.038
and we get some help from conflict
resolution expert Priya Parker.

00:19:15.579 --> 00:19:17.871
For a period of my life,
probably eight years,

00:19:17.871 --> 00:19:22.329
I began to realize the importance
of vision and clarity

00:19:22.663 --> 00:19:24.579
and conscious decision making.

00:19:24.746 --> 00:19:28.329
And I wanted to understand how to
help people get very, very,

00:19:28.329 --> 00:19:31.329
very clear on on their sense of purpose.